              <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Margin="2,6,2,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="{DynamicResource FgDim}"
                         Text="Changed shows, per byte, the bits that have changed since Reset stats (·· = never changed), so live signals stand out. While the monitor runs it owns the adapter: other adapter commands are refused, live data stops, and modules kept in an extended session return to their default session. A Bluetooth adapter may not keep up with a busy bus; overflows are counted."/>
